olor:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%"&gt;7,260&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#efefef;padding:0 1pt"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%"&gt;6,958&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The Company&#x2019;s proportion of net sales by disaggregated revenue source was generally consistent for each reportable segment in Note 10, &#x201c;Segment Information&#x201d; for the three- and nine-month periods ended June 27, 2026 and June&#160;28, 2025, except in Greater China, where iPhone revenue represented a moderately higher proportion of net sales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:18pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;As of June&#160;27, 2026 and September&#160;27, 2025, the Company had total deferred revenue of $14.9 billion and $13.7&#160;billion, respectively. As of June&#160;27, 2026, the Company expects 64% of total deferred revenue to be realized in less than a year, 23% within one-to-two years, 11% within two-to-three years and 2% in greater than three years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerTextBlock>
