lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;As of June&#160;27, 2026 and September&#160;27, 2025, the Company had outstanding fixed-rate notes with varying maturities for an aggregate carrying amount of $82.3 billion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;and $90.7 billion, respectively (collectively the &#x201c;Notes&#x201d;). As of June&#160;27, 2026 and September&#160;27, 2025, the fair value of the Company&#x2019;s Notes, based on Level 2 inputs, was&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;$71.2 billion and $80.4 billion, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:DebtDisclosureTextBlock>
